Grandma is cooking lunch. She cuts vegetables on the chopping board and cooks them in a big wok. She serves the soup with a ladle. Malis whisks the eggs and Grandma cooks them in a frying pan. She grates cheese with a grater. The kettle is hot: use an oven glove!

